      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = (2x + 1)\\ln x \\) for \\( x > 0 \\), and let \\( g(x) = \\dfrac{\\cos x}{1 + \\sin x} \\) for all \\( x \\) at which \\( \\sin x \\neq -1 \\)."
